                <pb facs="0242" n="130" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg130"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 180/43.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Pierrepont to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-07-09"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 9,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Pierrepont reports that executive authority was transferred on this date by
                    the President of Chile to Elias Fernandez Albano as vice president, and says the
                    President will leave on July 14, on the cruiser <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Esmeralda</hi>, for Panama.</p>
            </div>
